{"ID":"20230926144932-7z3up40","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926144932-7z3up40","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144932-7z3up40\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144936-4x9h1jo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144936-pf1dauu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144936-pf1dauu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:106,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:106\u0026#125;","title":"【甘草泻心汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926144936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926144936-4x9h1jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144936-4x9h1jo","updated":"20230926144936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：甘草四两（炙）、黄芩三两、干姜三两、半夏半升、黄连一两、大枣十二枚（劈）"}]},{"ID":"20230926144936-kybyf51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144936-kybyf51","updated":"20230926144936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右六味，以水一斗，煮取六升，去滓，再煎取三升，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926144936-pf1dauu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144936-pf1dauu","updated":"20230926144936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【13.9】狐惑之为病，状如伤寒，默默欲眠，目不得闭，卧起不安。蚀于喉为惑，蚀于阴为狐。不欲饮食，恶闻食臭，其面目乍赤、乍黑、乍白。蚀于上部则声嗄，甘草泻心汤主之；蚀于下部则咽干，苦参汤洗之；蚀于肛者，雄黄熏之。"}]}]}